    "README.md": "# Example Skill\n\nEnglish | [中文](./README.zh.md)\n\n## Overview\n\nA writing Skill for authors who turn notes into articles.\n\n## Preview\n\n![Article result](./assets/result.png)\n\n## Features\n\n| Capability | What it helps you do |\n|---|---|\n| Writing | Turn notes into an article. |\n\n## Installation\n\n### Requirements\n\nStart with a supported Agent client; optional image services can wait.\n\n| Item | Requirement |\n|---|---|\n| Agent client | Codex or another verified Skills client. |\n\n### Quick Installation\n\nSend this request to your Agent client:\n\n```text\nInstall this Skill: https://github.com/example/writing-skill\nCheck the core environment, prepare missing requirements, then install and verify loading. Optional services can wait.\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\nStart by creating an article:\n\n```text\nHelp me turn these notes into an article.\n```\n\n## Usage Examples\n\n```text\nWrite a short social post based on this article.\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe Skill organizes your notes and drafts text in your Agent client.\n\n## Repository Structure\n\n```text\nwriting-skill/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── assets/\n├── README.md\n├── README.zh.md\n└── LICENSE\n```\n\n## License\n\nMIT. See [LICENSE](./LICENSE).\n\n## About Me\n\nAn independent developer sharing practical content tools.\n",
    "README.zh.md": "# 示例 Skill\n\n[English](./README.md) | 中文\n\n## 项目简介\n\n这套写作 Skill 帮内容创作者把资料写成文章。\n\n## 效果预览\n\n![文章成果](./assets/result.png)\n\n## 核心功能\n\n| 能力 | 它能帮你做什么 |\n|---|---|\n| 写作 | 把资料写成文章。 |\n\n## 安装\n\n### 配置要求\n\n先准备好支持 Skills 的 Agent 客户端，其他服务用到时再配置。\n\n| 项目 | 要求 |\n|---|---|\n| Agent 客户端 | Codex 等已核实支持的客户端。 |\n\n### 快速安装\n\n打开 Agent 客户端，把这段话发给 Agent：\n\n```text\n帮我安装写作 Skill：https://github.com/example/writing-skill\n先检查基础环境，缺什么帮我补齐，再安装并检查能否加载。其他功能用到时再配置。\n```\n\n## 快速开始\n\n先试着写一篇文章：\n\n```text\n帮我把这些资料写成一篇公众号文章。\n```\n\n## 使用示例\n\n```text\n把这篇文章改成一篇小红书笔记。\n```\n\n## 工作原理\n\n整理资料后写成正文，由当前 Agent 客户端交付。\n\n## 目录结构\n\n```text\nwriting-skill/\n├── SKILL.md\n├── assets/\n├── README.md\n├── README.zh.md\n└── LICENSE\n```\n\n## 许可\n\n采用 MIT，见 [LICENSE](./LICENSE)。\n\n## 关于我\n\n分享实用内容工具的独立开发者。\n"
  },
